{"question_id":"lv5gst30","paperTitle":"JEE Main 2024 (Online) 8th April Morning Shift","year":2024,"subject":"physics","chapter":"alternating-current","chapterGroup":"electricity","type":"mcq","marks":4,"negMarks":1,"content":"<p>A LCR circuit is at resonance for a capacitor C, inductance L and resistance R. Now the value of resistance is halved keeping all other parameters same. The current amplitude at resonance will be now:</p>","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"halved\n"},{"identifier":"B","content":"same\n"},{"identifier":"C","content":"Zero\n"},{"identifier":"D","content":"double"}],"correct_options":["D"],"explanation":"<p>To solve this problem, we need to understand the relationship between the current amplitude in a series LCR circuit at resonance and the resistance <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.048ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.717ex\" height=\"1.593ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -683 759 704\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D445\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D445\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>. At resonance, the impedance <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.636ex\" height=\"1.545ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -683 723 683\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D44D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D44D\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> of the series LCR circuit is equal to the resistance <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.048ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.717ex\" height=\"1.593ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -683 759 704\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D445\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D445\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>, and thus:</p>\n\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.048ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"6.37ex\" height=\"1.593ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -683 2815.6 704\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D44D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D44D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1000.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(2056.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D445\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D445\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n\n<p>The amplitude of the current <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.375ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.983ex\" height=\"1.92ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -683 876.6 848.6\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D43C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D43C\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(473,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> at resonance is given by Ohm's law:</p>\n\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.814ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"7.627ex\" height=\"2.941ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -940 3371 1299.9\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D43C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D43C\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(473,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1154.3,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(2210.1,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(220,457.1) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D449\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D449\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(616,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(312.1,-345) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D445\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D445\"></use></g><rect width=\"920.9\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n\n<p>where <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.375ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.307ex\" height=\"1.92ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -683 1019.6 848.6\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D449\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D449\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(616,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> is the amplitude of the voltage supplied.</p>\n\n<p>Now, if the resistance <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.048ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.717ex\" height=\"1.593ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -683 759 704\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D445\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D445\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> is halved while keeping the voltage amplitude <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.375ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.307ex\" height=\"1.92ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -683 1019.6 848.6\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D449\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D449\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(616,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>, capacitance <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.05ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.719ex\" height=\"1.645ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 760 727\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D436\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D436\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>, and inductance <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.541ex\" height=\"1.545ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -683 681 683\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D43F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D43F\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> the same, the new resistance becomes:</p>\n\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.781ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"9.983ex\" height=\"2.765ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -877 4412.3 1222\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D445\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D445\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(792,-150) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D45B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(600,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D452\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D452\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1066,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D464\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D464\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2379.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(3435.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(220,394) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D445\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D445\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(311.6,-345) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><rect width=\"736.7\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n\n<p>The new current amplitude <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.618ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.983ex\" height=\"2.335ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -759 876.6 1032.1\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msubsup\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D43C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D43C\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(590.2,363) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"2032\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-V-2032\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(473,-257.5) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> at resonance is given by the modified Ohm's law:</p>\n\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -1.593ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"30.343ex\" height=\"3.72ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -940 13411.6 1644.1\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msubsup\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D43C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D43C\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(590.2,363) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"2032\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-V-2032\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(473,-257.5) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1154.3,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(2210.1,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(602.7,457.1) sca